9	// reading them in order will accept a plausible-looking set: that is exactly how
10	// the 368.7 MiB Vitest-provenance figure became a policy number, and how a
11	// queue-signature observation could become a causal claim about the historical
12	// 973.0/1,264.7 ms runs. So the conclusion is not written by a reader. It is
13	// computed here, from the receipts, under gates that must all pass BEFORE any
14	// scientific marker can be emitted, and the gates are themselves mutation-tested.
15	//
16	// WHAT IT IS NOT
17	// It has no bypass flag. There is deliberately no `--force`, no `--skip`, no
18	// `--only`, no environment escape and no way to downgrade a guard: a guard that
19	// can be turned off is not a guard, and mutants 8-10 exist precisely to prove
20	// that removing one is detectable.
21	//
