  reproduced: "THREE-WORKER A/B REPRODUCED AND SUPPORTS CREDENTIAL CONCURRENCY HYPOTHESIS",
  ordinary: "THREE-WORKER A/B ORDINARY QUEUE SIGNATURE ONLY — HISTORICAL RED NOT REPRODUCED",
